RELAXED_BOX 71.5672289513184 71.5752529449952 71.5875538820652

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-309.03989159764)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-309.03989159764)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
